### 商家确认售后申请（拒绝维修类型）
PUT http://116.205.111.229:8080/shops/2/aftersales/1010/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirm": false,
  "conclusion": "超出维修范围，拒绝申请",
  "type": 2
}

### 商家确认售后申请（拒绝-退货类型，无需改动）
PUT http://116.205.111.229:8080/shops/1/aftersales/1002/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirm": false,
  "conclusion": "商品无质量问题，不支持无理由退货",
  "type": 0
}

### 商家确认售后申请（同意-换货类型，无需serviceType）
PUT http://116.205.111.229:8080/shops/1/aftersales/1003/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirm": true,
  "conclusion": "审核通过，支持换货",
  "type": 1
}

